{"evt":"summary_set","id":"phase3/hybrid-retrieval","workspace":"D:/zonoid","summary":"Implemented Phase 3 hybrid retrieval in routes/graph.js. Change A: replaced scoreHybrid either/or cosine-fallback with RRF(cosine, BM25) fusion — both signals always contribute via 1/(k+rank_cosine)+1/(k+rank_bm25), k=60, BM25 uses stdlib-only TF-IDF with k1=1.2/b=0.75; gracefully degrades to BM25-only when embedding sidecar is loading. Change B: entity-seeded graph expansion added before ranking — matched entity nodes (by name substring or cosine>0.5) expand 1-2 hops along context edges to surface related notes; expansion is additive and no-op when entity_nodes is empty. All existing tests pass (search-knowledge: 5/5, phase2-integration: 31/31, structboost: 19/19, note-decay: 30/30). Committed on orch/attempt/phase3-hybrid-retrieval.","actor":"overlay-sync","ts":"2026-06-18T07:08:04.453Z"}
